# 5. DESIGN SYSTEM

## 5.1 The direction, in one paragraph

**Material 3 governs structure; the brand expresses through M3 theming plus one custom tactile button family.** The visual world is *Duolingo-chunky meets paper-and-ink reverence*: thick, sticker-like pressable surfaces with a hard offset "lip" that depresses on touch; a warm paper background instead of clinical white; one saturated emerald carrying every primary action; and a traditional Naskh face reserved exclusively for the matn so the sacred text never reads as game chrome.

The hard-offset lip (`4dp`, zero blur) is normally a costume — here it is the committed world, taken deliberately from Duolingo's chunky-button mechanic, and it is therefore the **only** place hard shadows appear. Everywhere else, depth is Material tonal elevation. **No gradients. No glassmorphism. No blurred colored halos. No neumorphism.**

