# 10. FORBIDDEN — any one of these fails the build

- Writing, paraphrasing or completing hadith text, takhrīj, grading, translation or scholarly explanation.
- Hadith-like placeholder or demo strings anywhere, including previews, tests and comments.
- Any runtime AI/LLM call, Gemini SDK, Firebase, analytics, ads, attribution or crash SDK in V1.
- An API key, token or secret in the repo or the binary.
- A network call required for any V1 feature.
- Login, registration or account creation in V1.
