- `System.currentTimeMillis()` / `Instant.now()` / `LocalDate.now()` outside `AppClock`.
- `paddingLeft` / `paddingRight` / `Alignment.*Left` / hardcoded LTR layout.
- Dimensions in `dp` for text, or any fixed-height text container.
- Baloo Bhaijaan 2 on the matn, or on any paragraph, or below 15sp.
- Noto Naskh on buttons or UI chrome.
- Gradients, glassmorphism, neumorphism, blurred colored halos, or hard offset shadows anywhere except the `ChunkyButton` lip.
- Dynamic Color / Material You deriving the palette from the wallpaper.
- Emoji as an icon. A raster PNG icon.
- `ease-in` on any UI motion; `scale(0f)` entrances; animating layout properties; a celebration animation on a frequent action.
- A buzzer, failure sound or error haptic playing over hadith audio or layered on the matn card.
- `Toast`. A blank screen. A control that looks tappable and does nothing. A silent failure.
- Colour as the only carrier of meaning.
- A dependency not on the §2 allowlist, without a `DECISIONS.md` justification.
- Asking me a question instead of deciding and recording the decision.

